{"id":"610e35470f5c7f53","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-finite-subobject-join.md","title":"Finite Join of Subobjects","display":"df-finite-subobject-join — Finite Join of Subobjects","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-finite-subobject-join","aliases":["93-df-finite-subobject-join"],"display":"df-finite-subobject-join — Finite Join of Subobjects","depends_on":["[[93-df-category]]","[[93-df-monomorphism]]","[[93-df-finite-subset]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-finite-subobject-join"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-finite-subobject-join</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-finite-subobject-join — Finite Join of Subobjects"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"aa74a8aadef06b6c\" href=\"?note=aa74a8aadef06b6c\" title=\"93-df-category\">93-df-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"58d8bff43d6d4102\" href=\"?note=58d8bff43d6d4102\" title=\"93-df-monomorphism\">93-df-monomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6b63f2f43b5511ee\" href=\"?note=6b63f2f43b5511ee\" title=\"93-df-finite-subset\">93-df-finite-subset</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(B\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}\\)</span> (the finite-set predicate used by <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6b63f2f43b5511ee\" href=\"?note=6b63f2f43b5511ee\" title=\"93-df-finite-subset\">93-df-finite-subset</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> is a finite index set, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf U:I\\to\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\mathbf U:I\\to\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf m\">\\(\\mathbf m\\)</span> is a family of arrows into <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mono}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Mono}_{93}\\)</span> (the monomorphism predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"58d8bff43d6d4102\" href=\"?note=58d8bff43d6d4102\" title=\"93-df-monomorphism\">93-df-monomorphism</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinSubJoin}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{FinSubJoin}_{93}\\)</span> (the finite-subobject-join predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite\\text{-}subobject\\text{-}join}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FinSubJoin}_{93}(U,m,B,I,\\mathbf U,\\mathbf m,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\land B,U\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\land\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(I)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathbf U:I\\to\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\land\n\\mathbf m\\in\\prod_{i\\in I}\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathbf U(i),B)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{Mono}_{93}(\\mathbf m(i),\\mathbf U(i),B,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Mono}_{93}(m,U,B,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists u\\;\\Bigl[u:I\\to V\\land\n\\forall i\\in I\\;\\bigl(u(i)\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathbf U(i),U)\n\\land m\\circ_{\\mathcal C}u(i)=\\mathbf m(i)\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall N\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(N,B)\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\mathrm{Mono}_{93}(n,N,B,\\mathcal C)\\land\n\\exists v\\;\\bigl[v:I\\to V\\land\n\\forall i\\in I\\;\\bigl(v(i)\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathbf U(i),N)\n\\land n\\circ_{\\mathcal C}v(i)=\\mathbf m(i)\\bigr)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\\exists!r\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(U,N)\\;(n\\circ_{\\mathcal C}r=m)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite\\text{-}subobject\\text{-}join}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FinSubJoin}_{93}(U,m,B,I,\\mathbf U,\\mathbf m,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\land B,U\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\land\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(I)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathbf U:I\\to\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\land\n\\mathbf m\\in\\prod_{i\\in I}\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathbf U(i),B)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{Mono}_{93}(\\mathbf m(i),\\mathbf U(i),B,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Mono}_{93}(m,U,B,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists u\\;\\Bigl[u:I\\to V\\land\n\\forall i\\in I\\;\\bigl(u(i)\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathbf U(i),U)\n\\land m\\circ_{\\mathcal C}u(i)=\\mathbf m(i)\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall N\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(N,B)\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\mathrm{Mono}_{93}(n,N,B,\\mathcal C)\\land\n\\exists v\\;\\bigl[v:I\\to V\\land\n\\forall i\\in I\\;\\bigl(v(i)\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathbf U(i),N)\n\\land n\\circ_{\\mathcal C}v(i)=\\mathbf m(i)\\bigr)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\\exists!r\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(U,N)\\;(n\\circ_{\\mathcal C}r=m)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the least upper bound of a finite family of subobjects of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>. Allowing <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I=\\varnothing\">\\(I=\\varnothing\\)</span> includes the bottom subobject, so the predicate covers nullary as well as nonempty finite unions.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"aa74a8aadef06b6c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-monomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"58d8bff43d6d4102","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-monomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-finite-subset","status":"resolved","id":"6b63f2f43b5511ee","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-finite-subset]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-finite-subset","status":"resolved","id":"6b63f2f43b5511ee","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}$ (the finite-set predicate used by [[93-df-finite-subset]])","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-monomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"58d8bff43d6d4102","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Mono}_{93}$ (the monomorphism predicate of [[93-df-monomorphism]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"B\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf U:I\\to\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf m","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Mono}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FinSubJoin}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite\\text{-}subobject\\text{-}join}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{FinSubJoin}_{93}(U,m,B,I,\\mathbf U,\\mathbf m,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\land B,U\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\land\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(I)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathbf U:I\\to\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\land\n\\mathbf m\\in\\prod_{i\\in I}\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathbf U(i),B)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{Mono}_{93}(\\mathbf m(i),\\mathbf U(i),B,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Mono}_{93}(m,U,B,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&\\land\\exists u\\;\\Bigl[u:I\\to V\\land\n\\forall i\\in I\\;\\bigl(u(i)\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathbf U(i),U)\n\\land m\\circ_{\\mathcal C}u(i)=\\mathbf m(i)\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&\\land\\forall N\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(N,B)\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&\\quad\\mathrm{Mono}_{93}(n,N,B,\\mathcal C)\\land\n\\exists v\\;\\bigl[v:I\\to V\\land\n\\forall i\\in I\\;\\bigl(v(i)\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathbf U(i),N)\n\\land n\\circ_{\\mathcal C}v(i)=\\mathbf m(i)\\bigr)\\bigr]\\\\\n&\\quad\\to\\exists!r\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(U,N)\\;(n\\circ_{\\mathcal C}r=m)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"I=\\varnothing","display":false}],"bytes":2121,"backlinks":[{"id":"dbf8e12e31001be4","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FinSubJoin}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{Pullback}_{93}$ (see [[93-df-finite-subobject-join]] and [[93-df-pullback]])"}],"outgoing":["aa74a8aadef06b6c","58d8bff43d6d4102","6b63f2f43b5511ee"]}